# Line/sector specials dispatcher and utilities, ported from p_spec.c.
#
# EV_*/P_* thinkers for doors/floor/plats/ceiling/lights/switch/telept are
# already in their own Flow modules - this file only owns pic anims, cross/
# shoot/sector events, surrounding-sector helpers, EV_DoDonut, and spawn/
# update of specials. Engine structs use GEOM_*/MOBJ_*. buttonlist is
# Flow-owned here (SWITCH_* APIs). activeceilings / activeplats use
# specshim_* accessors.
#
# Private records use Flow structs (SpecAnim / AnimDef). floormove_t for
# EV_DoDonut keeps LP64 offsetof access (shared with floor.flow layout).

